<section class="pkg-faq-band">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Is the storage secure and insured?</summary><p>Yes. We arrange secure, insured storage for belongings not moving straight into your new home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long can I store my belongings?</summary><p>Gold Prestige includes up to 6 weeks of storage. If you need longer, talk to us when you plan your move so we can explain the options.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if my sale and my new home do not line up?</summary><p>That is exactly what storage is for. Up to 6 weeks of storage is included in Gold Prestige to bridge a gap between your sale completion and your new-home move-in date.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I store furniture while I am downsizing?</summary><p>Yes. If your new home is smaller, or you are not yet sure what will fit, Chayce can book secure, insured storage for furniture and belongings and arrange collection and delivery when you need them.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do I have to arrange the storage myself?</summary><p>No. Chayce handles booking the storage and arranging collection or delivery when you need it.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

